{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814370/extras/b6c79de4a609860ea0fc9e0e8d7c41f7.avif?t=1765717957\" width=616 height=200 /></span> <br>The war ended in a blinding flash. Now, the earth is hollow, a fractured shell hiding the remnants of humanity. A new era of evolution is about to begin. Survivors fled underground, but salvation was a lie. A sickness spread, warping minds, twisting bodies. No one is being spared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a child, taken to a hidden facility deep below the surface. You don\u2019t know why. Only that you\u2019re sick. That everyone is. And something is wrong.You have to escape. Crawl through the vents. Follow the echoes to get to the surface. Your mother is waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814370/extras/af2efba060ab6c25ca4912f959bba658.avif?t=1765717957\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore a surreal, underground facility\u00a0</strong>by clicking through rooms, searching for clues, interacting with objects, and uncovering hidden paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814370/extras/a3e53f65b2e671c1660924fbb6b2a100.avif?t=1765717957\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Converse with strange and varied characters</strong>, your choices affect what you learn and who you can trust.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814370/extras/948893d709488e258862d0062a2a8840.avif?t=1765717957\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Crawl through dark vents</strong> to move between areas. The\u00a0<strong>Rat Maze is\u00a0</strong>a skill-based mini-game with multiple paths!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814370/extras/fccaca57e3f701d1b63bf73650c208a8.avif?t=1765717957\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choices matter</strong>: your decisions shape the narrative, unlock secrets, and determine which of the <strong>multiple endings</strong> you reach.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814370?t=1765717957","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814370?t=1765717957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814370/7f16a9b7cafddcc4ec0e02b0443f29a22e1e78de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765717957","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814370/7f16a9b7cafddcc4ec0e02b0443f29a22e1e78de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765717957","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4078780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class